        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Andy Borowitz, Will Smith, Joseph Marcell\n- Products: The Fresh Prince of Bel-Air, The Borowitz Report\n- Organizations: NBC\n- Topics: American sitcoms, satire, television roles\n\nFacts:\n- Joseph Marcell was born on 18 August 1948 and is a Saint Lucian-born British actor.\n- Andy Borowitz was born on January 4, 1958 and is an American writer, comedian, satirist, and actor.\n- The Fresh Prince of Bel-Air originally aired on NBC from September 10, 1990, to May 20, 1996.\n- Andy Borowitz is known for creating The Fresh Prince of Bel-Air and the satirical column The Borowitz Report.\n- Joseph Marcell is best known for playing Geoffrey the butler on the NBC sitcom The Fresh Prince of Bel-Air from September 1990 until May 1996.\n- The Fresh Prince of Bel-Air stars Will Smith as a fictionalized version of himself, a street-smart teenager from West Philadelphia who moves into his wealthy aunt and uncle's Bel Air mansion after a fight on a local basketball court.",
